OL,3,GNEWSACake shed owner chased thief who
OL,4,Astole her bakes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baker ran down a high street, covered
OL,7,Fin flour and cake mix, to retrieve
OL,8,Fthree sweet treats stolen from her
OL,9,Fhonesty box cake shed.
OL,11,FJade Walton runs JD Bakes in Clay
OL,12,FCross, Derbyshire, and asks her
OL,13,Fcustomers to make cash payments into a
OL,14,Fsecure cash box or online payments via
OL,15,Fa displayed QR code.
OL,17,FBut when one customer failed to pay,
OL,18,Fthe mum of two gave chase and filmed
OL,19,Fthe pursuit on her phone "more for my
OL,20,Fsafety".
